          "text": "{\"clauses\":[{\"name\":\"Preamble – Effective agreement and collaboration\",\"start_line\":32,\"end_line\":36,\"head\":\"This Agreement, effective upon signing, governs an arrangement\",\"tail\":\"to the terms and conditions set forth below.\"},{\"name\":\"1. Material and retained rights\",\"start_line\":38,\"end_line\":45,\"head\":\"1. The biological material to be provided to\",\"tail\":\"forms of the Material made by St. Jude.\"},{\"name\":\"2. Permitted users and custody\",\"start_line\":46,\"end_line\":49,\"head\":\"2. The Material is for use by Recipient\",\"tail\":\"the immediate and direct control of Redplent Scientist.\"},{\"name\":\"3. Permitted research use\",\"start_line\":50,\"end_line\":51,\"head\":\"3. Recipient Scientist agrees that the Material will\",\"tail\":\"receptor construct to be used in pre-clinical studies.\"},{\"name\":\"4. Human and commercial use restrictions\",\"start_line\":52,\"end_line\":54,\"head\":\"4. The Material may not be used in\",\"tail\":\"will not be used for any commercial purpose.\"},{\"name\":\"5. Distribution rights\",\"start_line\":55,\"end_line\":56,\"head\":\"5. St. Jude retains the unresteicted rig ht\",\"tail\":\"the Material to other commercial or noncommercial entities.\"},{\"name\":\"6. Joint publication\",\"start_line\":58,\"end_line\":60,\"head\":\"6. Recipient agrees that any publications that result\",\"tail\":\"be jointly published in accordance with academic standards.\"},{\"name\":\"7. Rights, termination, and destruction\",\"start_line\":61,\"end_line\":86,\"head\":\"7. The transfer of the Material grants te\",\"tail\":\"of the agreement, Recipient shall destroyall unused Materials.\"},{\"name\":\"8. Commercialization, patents, and license\",\"start_line\":88,\"end_line\":95,\"head\":\"a. Recipient shall not commercialize any product that\",\"tail\":\"that arise from the use of the Materials.\"},{\"name\":\"9. Disclaimer of warranties\",\"start_line\":97,\"end_line\":102,\"head\":\"9. The Material provided is experimental in nature,\",\"tail\":\"WILL NOT iNFRINGE ANY PATENT OR OTHER PROPRIEJARYBIGHT--.\"},{\"name\":\"10. Liability limitation\",\"start_line\":103,\"end_line\":112,\"head\":\"10. Except to the extent prohibited by taw,\",\"tail\":\"gross negligence or willful misconduct of St. Jude.\"}]}",
